# Template only -- names, never real values. scripts/staging-deploy-drill.cjs
# generates the real `staging.env` (gitignored) with random passwords for
# each local drill run and deletes it afterwards. This file documents the
# shape ("secrets/variables por entorno") for a real staging account later.

